        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN150TEKFBR, Lewis Offset Teak Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe offset teak wood door pull is very durable. Teak is a very hard and strong type of wood that is resistant to insects and warping--even when exposed directly to harsh weather. This makes it the ideal choice for exterior doors. The Lewis offset teak wood door pull is a great pull for both commercial doors and residential doors. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths in a wide array of bracket finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available with different types of wood handles <a href=\"/products/lewis-offset-wood-door-pull-first-impressions-lgn150fbr\"><b>Lewis Offset Wood Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Lewis 01 Teak Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LWS01-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions LGN150TEKFBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LGN150018TEKFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150024TEKFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LGN150036TEKFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Offset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Offset Teak Door Pull",
                "description": "The Offset Teak Door Pull is very durable. Teak is a very hard and strong type of wood that is resistant to insects and warping--even when exposed directly to harsh weather. This makes it the ideal choice for exterior doors. The Lewis Offset Teak Door Pull is a great pull for both commercial doors and residential doors. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths in a wide array of bracket finishes.\r\n",
